repository-code: "https://github.com/matrixNeo76/Edge-of-Chaos"
abstract: >-
  Falsifiable research programme and digital-twin metrology platform
  (Python + Rust) testing the necessary physical conditions for primary
  interoceptive sentience in continuous neuromorphic substrates. Implements
  a practical proxy of the thermodynamic/allostatic valence functional Psi(t)
  (its dissipation terms are heuristic, not Hatano-Sasa estimates), the three
  operational demarcation conditions (causal non-separability, non-Markovian
  memory, state-dependent effective dynamics) and criteria for three of the
  necessary conditions (edge of chaos, causal degeneracy, exponent stability)
  of the P0_Distilled v0.1 research programme.
keywords:
  - neuromorphic computing
  - memristors
  - edge of chaos
  - interoceptive sentience
  - consciousness research
  - thermodynamic valence
  - falsifiability
  - digital twin
  - Rust
  - Python
  - PyO3
